        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiztal Games introduces <i>Quiz Quest</i>: a mind-stretching, collaborative quizcapade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends and family, using your smartphones as your controllers, and put your heads together as you journey to achieve the rank of Master Quizards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fallen knight Sir Answerlot needs you to take up his failed quest to rid the kingdom of its most hated tormentor: the evil dragon Spontanius the Combustor. You will need to keep your wits about you as you encounter many allies and enemies, make many crucial decisions and answer many, many quiz questions along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for casual gaming sessions, <i>Quiz Quest</i> is played as a single experience much like a board game or escape room: one playthrough can last between 45-75 minutes depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--With the game displayed on a central screen, your team of 2-6 players begins by choosing your individual stats and a weapon each. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Stats affect which question categories you favour, how characters perceive you and which dialogue responses you can give. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--The weapons have unique abilities to assist with quizzing and, when prompted, can be used during character interactions with varying results. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Your team’s goal is to answer enough questions correctly by the end of your adventure to reach a high enough Quid score to become Master Quizards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--But there is more to questing than just quizzing: each character that you meet has their own story to tell, and what you learn or receive from them might affect the course of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, Quizards!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiztal Games introduces <i>Quiz Quest</i>: a mind-stretching, collaborative quizcapade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends and family, using your smartphones as your controllers, and put your heads together as you journey to achieve the rank of Master Quizards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fallen knight Sir Answerlot needs you to take up his failed quest to rid the kingdom of its most hated tormentor: the evil dragon Spontanius the Combustor. You will need to keep your wits about you as you encounter many allies and enemies, make many crucial decisions and answer many, many quiz questions along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for casual gaming sessions, <i>Quiz Quest</i> is played as a single experience much like a board game or escape room: one playthrough can last between 45-75 minutes depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--With the game displayed on a central screen, your team of 2-6 players begins by choosing your individual stats and a weapon each. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Stats affect which question categories you favour, how characters perceive you and which dialogue responses you can give. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--The weapons have unique abilities to assist with quizzing and, when prompted, can be used during character interactions with varying results. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Your team’s goal is to answer enough questions correctly by the end of your adventure to reach a high enough Quid score to become Master Quizards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--But there is more to questing than just quizzing: each character that you meet has their own story to tell, and what you learn or receive from them might affect the course of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, Quizards!</p>",
        "short_description": "A co-op quiz party game with an interactive fantasy story played through a desktop screen and smartphones.",
